:8","global_turn_index":264,"locator":"[S15T8]","raw_turn_sha256":"9af1ba689030eda71a7b77e81646c11c178028488b84bf8033f065df2fe09019","rendered_turn_sha256":"64e0eeace93b6a1c739d8bf14528b557eee23e4d90c888a3787a3d1d820486b8","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"967c01aaa2141158daa2dc3c85fc919a51ebce9643d8bb45820096ec28dbb7b0","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":8},{"dia_id":"D15:9","global_turn_index":265,"locator":"[S15T9]","raw_turn_sha256":"9149495844c6d0efab8c6b5f86eb20440d131165f10522ff56f408f00cf08440","rendered_turn_sha256":"d190482b2dafdddc94cbcea454f37effd8cb8f22f6836b8fb978b4ff7791e992","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"25fab13cfdd291b88d6f13b5d259c20639543245b0357e33ee1fa33ef4d9ec70","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":9},{"dia_id":"D15:10","global_turn_index":266,"locator":"[S15T10]","raw_turn_sha256":"9901b0291ff8e0b0a3fd35124d8e964e3bdacb96269fde36bac179d5f05e89b8","rendered_turn_sha256":"d0138c592f6803bbfd4d5b7fde78e3feff0838eb6da37e173dd674b8ed3ff2d7","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"7c4f6656aaf11057ea3c33f648e693246b7e36baf28e41a95841f0f598714d45","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":10}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin! Haven't talked in a while! Last Friday I had a card-night with my friends, it was so much fun. We laughed and had a great time! Take a look at the photo!\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of men sitting at a table with playing cards]\n[S15T1] (dia_id: D15:1)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave! Great to hear from you, card night sounds like a blast! Always love having fun with friends. Guess what? I scored a deal to continue collaboration with Frank Ocean! This is a dream come true for me, I've been working hard and it's finally paying off. No words can describe how happy I am.\n[S15T2] (dia_id: D15:2)\n\nDave: Wow Calvin, congrats! Super excited for you. How did this chance come up?\n[S15T3] (dia_id: D15:3)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I had the opportunity to meet Frank Ocean at a music festival in Tokyo and we clicked. We've been speaking and sharing ideas we arranged a meeting and recorded a song in the studio at my mansion - it's been great!\n[S15T4] (dia_id: D15:4)\n\nDave: Wow, Tokyo sounds like an incredible experience!\n[S15T5] (dia_id: D15:5)\n\nCalvin: It was an incredible experience, Dave! The city was buzzing with energy and the festival crowd was so lively - it was like fuel for my soul. Look at this photo, that's amazing!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people sitting on the grass at night]\n[S15T6] (dia_id: D15:6)\n\nDave: Wow, that sounds incredible! What was it like playing at the festival? Must have been an amazing experience.\n[S15T7] (dia_id: D15:7)\n\nCalvin: It was a dream come true, Dave! The festival had buzzing energy and a super upbeat crowd. We all felt connected, it was amazing!\n[S15T8] (dia_id: D15:8)\n\nDave: Sounds like you had a blast! Did any other collaborations come out of that performance? Any upcoming concerts we should know about?\n[S15T9] (dia_id: D15:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah Dave, someone even noticed my performance and now we're working together, which is wild. My tour ends soon and I'm heading to Boston. Maybe we can meet up then!\n[S15T10] (dia_id: D15:10)","text_sha256":"10160aff9934f3904b4b68463f13b472df3fc2b5a60f29fd03c276f35cf78497","timestamp":"2023-08-22T11:06:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":292,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestratio